      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Automated ICANN RDAP Official Domain WHOIS, Brand & Antifraud Auditor Pipeline (Daily B2B M2M Workflow)\n\n**Overview:**\nAudits corporate and e-commerce domains via official ICANN & Verisign RDAP JSON registries (Zero-Key, replaces paid WHOIS APIs). Extracts registration/expiration dates, registrar, DNSSEC, lock status, and Domain Trust Scores (0-100).\n\n**Powered by Apify Actor:** [b2b-quant-apis/icann-rdap-domain-whois-brand-recon](https://apify.com/b2b-quant-apis/icann-rdap-domain-whois-brand-recon)\n\n### Quick Setup (2 Minutes):\n1. Create a free Apify account and copy your personal token from **Settings -> Integrations**.\n2. Open the **Apify Engine: icann-rdap-domain-whois-brand-recon** HTTP Request node and configure a **Header Auth** credential with:\n   - **Name:** `Authorization`\n   - **Value:** `Bearer <YOUR_APIFY_TOKEN_HERE>`\n3. Customize the JSON input payload in the HTTP Request node and set your destination Webhook/Slack URL.\n4. Toggle the workflow **Active** to run automatically every morning at 07:00 AM!",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "c3cac1e5-cead-5627-954c-00e4bca91488",
      "name": "Setup Instructions & Architecture",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        180,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
